 ## Performance
 
 These settings change how the app hands frames to the screen and how it prepares the GPU's work. The game's tested defaults are a good start; change them when a game stutters, runs hot, or you want less latency.
+
+### Memory transfer optimization
+
+NVN games only; enabled by default. It continues compatible render passes,
+avoids stores of unchanged color attachments, and lets ordinary feedback
+snapshots remain eligible for lossless compression. Required feedback
+copies and their barrier/submission invalidation remain. Turn it off to
+compare the previous policy or if rendering errors appear; Play applies
+and saves the choice. Existing environment overrides take priority.
 
